16
00:00:42.866 --> 00:00:44.266
Y el asesino es...

17
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.800
tu propio hermano, Bastián.

18
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.700
no vas a

19
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.400
